                                    text="&lt;p>&lt;sup>1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sup>SKYRIZI, SmPC.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;sup>2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sup>Le Berre, C. et al. (2023). “Ulcerative Colitis.” Lancet. 402(10401):571-584. doi: https://doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(23)00966-2&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;sup>3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sup>Crohn &amp;amp; Colitis NL &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crohn-colitis.nl/over-crohn-colitis/wat-is-colitis-ulcerosa/&quot;>Wat is colitis ulcerosa? - Crohn en Colitis NL (crohn-colitis.nl)&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;sup>4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sup>National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases. “Ulcerative Colitis.” https://www.niddk.nih.gov/health-information/digestive-diseases/ulcerative-colitis/all-content. Updated September 2020. Accessed July 15, 2024.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;sup>5.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sup>Rapport, F. et al. (2019). “Patient Views About the Impact of Ulcerative Colitis and Its Management With Drug Treatment and Surgery: A Nested Qualitative Study Within the CONSTRUCT Trial&lt;i>.&lt;/i>”&lt;i> BMC Gastroenterol.&lt;/i> 19(1):166.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;sup>6.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sup>Duvallet, E. et al. (2011). “Interleukin-23: A Key Cytokine in Inflammatory Diseases.” &lt;i>Ann Med.&lt;/i> 43(7):503-511. doi:10.3109/07853890.2011.577093.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>&lt;sup>7.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/sup>Moschen, A.R. et al. (2019). “IL-12, IL-23 and IL-17 in IBD: Immunobiology and Therapeutic Targeting.” &lt;i>Nat Rev Gastroenterol Hepatol.&lt;/i> 16(3):185-196. doi:10.1038/s41575-018-0084-8.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>NL-SKZG-250016&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
